67
00:07:42.643 --> 00:07:44.468
Option A: Gorm.

68
00:07:44.468 --> 00:07:46.355
Option B: Harald.

69
00:07:46.355 --> 00:07:48.372
Option C: Christian.
[DA] Hvad hedder Kronprins Frederik og Kronprinsesse Marys ældste søn?  A: Gorm  |  B: Harald  |  C: Christian

70
00:07:54.922 --> 00:07:57.147
The answer is C: Christian.

71
00:07:57.097 --> 00:08:01.374
It appeared in the June 2020 and November 2022 exams.
[DA] ✔ C: Christian

72
