Question 2.

73
00:08:03.124 --> 00:08:06.999
In which year did Margrethe the Second become queen of Denmark?

74
00:08:06.999 --> 00:08:09.661
Option A: 1972.

75
00:08:09.661 --> 00:08:12.149
Option B: 1982.

76
