78
00:08:24.047 --> 00:08:28.314
It appeared in the June 2022 and May 2024 exams.
[DA] ✔ A: 1972

79
00:08:28.864 --> 00:08:30.201
Question 3.

80
00:08:30.151 --> 00:08:33.789
