Option C: Frederik the Tenth.
[DA] Hvem blev Danmarks nye konge i januar 2024?  A: Frederik den 4.  |  B: Frederik den 7.  |  C: Frederik den 10.

84
00:08:48.178 --> 00:08:50.740
The answer is C: Frederik the Tenth.

85
00:08:50.690 --> 00:08:53.286
It appeared in the May 2024 exam.
[DA] ✔ C: Frederik den 10.

86
00:08:53.836 --> 00:08:55.136
Question 4.

87
00:08:55.086 --> 00:08:58.273
Which country does Queen Mary originally come from?

88
00:08:58.273 --> 00:08:59.936
Option A: Canada.

89
00:08:59.936 --> 00:09:02.223
Option B: Great Britain.

90
00:09:02.223 --> 00:09:04.176
Option C: Australia.
[DA] Hvilket land kommer dronning Mary oprindeligt fra?  A: Canada  |  B: Storbritannien  |  C: Australien

91
00:09:10.726 --> 00:09:12.876
The answer is C: Australia.

92
00:09:12.826 --> 00:09:15.498
It appeared in the May 2025 exam.
[DA] ✔ C: Australien

93
00:09:15.948 --> 00:09:17.820
Question 5.

94
00:09:17.820 --> 00:09:22.740
In which castle in Copenhagen does the king and his family live part of the year?

95
00:09:22.740 --> 00:09:25.188
Option A: Christiansborg.

96
00:09:25.188 --> 00:09:27.444
Option B: Rosenborg.

97
00:09:27.444 --> 00:09:29.820
